WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.660
Yes, I made a cosme corner that I will use at the next fashion show.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.250
It's so cute!

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.250
I'm also going to participate in Prettyholic's make-up.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.720
Yes, you will come to see us, right?

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:49.280
Yes, I will! I'm looking forward to it!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:53.890
Miyuki-chan! Help me!

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:54.890
Who is this?

00:00:54.890 --> 00:01:00.000
Connie-san! What are you doing in such a hurry?

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:08.520
In fact, the model who was supposed to appear on the show couldn't come out alone, so I had to find someone to replace her in a hurry.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.150
That's a nightmare.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:15.230
Is it easy to find a girl who fits the costume image?

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.240
If you can find it so easily, it won't be hard.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.800
Oh!

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.310
Oh!

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.340
A charisma designer's...

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:40.450
I know I'm Connie, but more importantly, you.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.130
I've found you!

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.380
Perfect for your image!

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:45.890
Want to try it?

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:46.640
Model!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.510
What is a fashion show?

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:42.110
It's a pretty collection.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:46.050
My mom helps me with the cosmetics shop every year.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:49.240
Does that mean you walk on the runway?

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.770
Yes, that's right.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:54.090
Hey, what is that runway?

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:57.200
It's a flower road where models walk.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.000
I walk on the runway and give clothes to the customers.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.590
I'm going to show you the fashion show.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.620
Hmm, you're walking with everyone's attention.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.540
It's not bad.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.220
That's right.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.330
I don't mind going to that fashion show.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:19.170
What are you talking about? It's not that easy to get out.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:21.090
Is that so amazing?

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:24.510
That blue sky pretty collection.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.190
Yeah.

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:30.000
The pretty collection is a fashionable fashion brand.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:39.440
There are so many of them, and all of them are shiny and cute, and even I can feel happy when I look at them.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:50.520
I've loved and admired them for a long time, so I'm so happy.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.470
I can feel Sango's passion.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:55.860
I'm sorry I'm excited by myself.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.780
It's okay. It's very tropical.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.660
If you like her that much, you better do your best!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.920
We're going to see her too.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.040
Leave the cheering to me.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.240
I'll show you how to stand.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.300
Make your posture better.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.850
Pull your chin.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:48.150
Then, from the tip of your head straight down.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:52.200
Be aware that there is a core in the center of your body.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.960
If you do that, you'll be able to get a good balance.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.230
You don't have to stop breathing, do you?

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.090
I know!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.080
Huh?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.350
What's that outfit?

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.270
It's a costume for the fashion show.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.410
Miyuki-san, I'm coming in!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.800
Since we're all here, do you want to try it on?

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.030
Are you sure?

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:19.510
Yes. It's a sample, so there's no problem.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:25.750
What's wrong?

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:26.750
This skirt...

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.740
If I do this, I can see the pattern.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.000
Really?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:35.540
That's right. It's a waste if you can't see it even though you have a cute pattern.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:43.820
That's right. In fashion shows, it is important to convey the charm of the clothes to the customer.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.710
The charm of the clothes?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:50.700
It is also the model's job to think about how to make the clothes look the best.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:59.060
Is that different from showing yourself cute in those clothes?

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:10.680
You say that often, but models deliver their cuteness to their customers.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.830
Deliver their cuteness?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.810
I'll give you the usual medicine.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.910
Don't get too irritated.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:20.980
Okay.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:26.910
By the way, I saw a fashion show sign near the beach the other day.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.930
Oh, really?

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.000
If you go there,

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.980
I wonder if the audience has a lot of motivation?

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.890
Me again? No, it's troublesome.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:40.860
You see, I have to organize the cart that I had to delay.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.160
Haa.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:48.430
Numeri-san is the only one who can ask for this.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:49.570
Why?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.910
First of all, Numeri-san has a great fashion sense.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.910
There is no such person who can wear white clothes so beautifully.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.730
Eh, is that so?

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.000
And then, it's a modern style.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.720
and bold hairstyles!

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.240
How fashionable!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.120
Is that so?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.990
This is what a fashionista is!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.850
It's a swimming trend!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.190
Oh my!

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:11.270
The world of the sea, number one!

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.890
Huh?

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.750
The balloons are delayed?

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.690
They're caught in a traffic jam.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:22.120
For now, I'll report this to Connie-san.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.400
Hmm...

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:38.050
It was the first time I entered the backstage.

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:43.190
I'm going to do my makeup here.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:52.570
It's the last one, right?

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:55.470
Nice to meet you today, you two.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.070
Super success!

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.120
No, let's make it a great success!

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:02.880
Of course!

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:05.750
We're starting the rehearsal!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:12.850
All the models, please gather here!

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:21.010
Everyone, do it as if it's the real show!

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.010
Let's make the cutest show possible!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:28.840
What should I do?

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.220
It's bigger than I thought

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.560
As a member of the model team, I'm going to make this show a success!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:17.870
Are you okay? Calm down.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.840
Okay! Let's start!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.620
My legs...

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:37.440
can't move...

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.810
I can't move...

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:42.420
Huh?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.400
What's wrong?

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.720
Are you injured?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:47.000
Tango!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:23.560
Don't worry too much.

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:26.330
It'll be fine if you do it the way you practice.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.220
You're going to show everyone how cute you are, right, Sango?

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.650
What should I do...

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.710
I wonder if I can walk on the runway with Ban-chan...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.680
I started going to the gym recently.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.530
Me too.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.960
Basically, it's bodybuilding, right?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:48.350
Maybe I'm wrong after all...

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.270
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:56.140
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:57.140
I'm looking forward to it.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.800
Who is that?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:08.850
It's not over yet, is it?

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:09.770
4!

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:10.690
4!

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:14.660
4!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:18.710
But somehow...

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:33.110
I'll take the motivation power.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.350
What?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.850
Did you just get it?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:39.520
I was really in a hurry, but in the end...

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.160
What should I do?

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.640
I don't have the last balloon.

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.050
Even if you say that...

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:52.750
Hey, something's wrong.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.850
Is the motivation taken away?

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.240
I can't help it if you get caught.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.420
Numeri!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.630
I'm not going to do it.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.190
I'll steal the remaining motivation power.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.520
I'll do it!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:23.400
Prickly-eared Tropical Changing!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:28.580
Snake Catch!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.370
One eye, one form, Flamingo!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:13.000
The king of the world, Cure La Meri!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:25.320
Cure La Meri!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:59.890
Everyone, let's go to the next level!

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:03.130
Let's hurry up and finish it.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.610
But... the time is...

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.520
Hmm...

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:09.070
But...

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:15.380
This balloon is definitely cuter.

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:20.220
Isn't it?

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:27.060
I'll help you, too!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.830
Me, too! Me, too!

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.670
Me too!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:49.300
I'm in a hurry!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:53.970
I'm the one who got you into trouble!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:58.930
I didn't expect you to be collecting balloons at a fashion show.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.000
Yes, I was expecting it.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:09.010
But, if this can improve the show even a little bit,

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:12.900
that would be really exciting, right?

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:19.650
Ah, can I have that balloon in this basket?

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:23.640
I see...

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:27.410
We love cute things.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:27.910
Wow!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.270
You too, right?

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.290
I've been watching you.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:41.340
You've been working hard on your lessons to deliver your cuteness, haven't you?

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:47.080
As long as you have that love, you'll be fine.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.660
Nice to meet you.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:14.990
I felt the same way.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:23.390
I saw it.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:27.170
Can you come to your friend's place?

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.380
Go through the runway there.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.050
No, no, no!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.800
If you're scared, you don't have to push yourself too hard.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.440
Even if you don't want to do it...

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:38.200
No!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.590
What I'm going to do is...

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:01.800
Riku!

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.140
I won't forgive you!

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:16.930
Hello! I'm the original Coral!

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.770
Refusion!

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:24.450
I'm the original Coral!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:30.000
I'm the original Coral! I'm the name of Kuwapop!

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.280
Walking Power, Comeback!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.000
The "Astora Pretty Collection" will now begin!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.880
It's done.

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.090
Well then, do your best.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:18.370
It looks like I didn't see anything wrong.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:27.430
The clothes you're wearing are so cute.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.410
Yeah, they're wonderful.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:04.800
I'm so happy to be here!
